# episode12\branches\ep12_jm_branch.rpy:1151
translate schinese ep12_msolo_label_a7eed8e8:

    # mc "I would have, but there's the party, and I'm having that fighting competition the day after tomorrow."
    mc "我本来是打算去的，不过有聚会，而且后天还有个打架比赛。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_jm_branch.rpy:1152
translate schinese ep12_msolo_label_ff3b247a:

    # mc "You can still come, right?"
    mc "你还能来，对吧？"

# episode12\branches\ep12_jm_branch.rpy:1154
translate schinese ep12_msolo_label_a47b878e:

    # my "I wouldn't miss it. I'll come watch together with Sage and Josy."
    my "我可不会错过。我会和Sage还有Josy一起来看。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_jm_branch.rpy:1156
translate schinese ep12_msolo_label_0aea444f:

    # mc "It's scary having you there to watch me fight, but I feel good knowing I have some people cheering me on."
    mc "有你在旁边看着我打架确实有点吓人，但知道有你们在为我加油，我感觉挺好的。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_jm_branch.rpy:1158
translate schinese ep12_msolo_label_2d281fb7:

    # my "Haha! Oh, you'll hear me! I'll scream as loudly as I can for you."
    my "哈哈！哦，你到时候会听到的！我会尽可能大声地为你呐喊！"

# episode12\branches\ep12_jm_branch.rpy:1160
translate schinese ep12_msolo_label_f0edc902:

    # mc "I would have, but there's the party, and I'm performing at the faculty party the day after tomorrow."
    mc "我本来想的，但有聚会，而且我明天还要在教职员工聚会上表演。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_jm_branch.rpy:1161
translate schinese ep12_msolo_label_118da446:

    # mc "So, I need to practice some more for it."
    mc "所以，我得再多练练。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_jm_branch.rpy:1163
translate schinese ep12_msolo_label_1e2de6a2:

    # my "And here I am stealing your free night."
    my "我这边倒是占用了你一个免费的夜晚。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_jm_branch.rpy:1166
translate schinese ep12_msolo_label_e4dd8327:

    # mc "You're worth it."
    mc "你值得这一切。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_jm_branch.rpy:1168
translate schinese ep12_msolo_label_e3508715:

    # mc "This, right here, makes it worth it."
    mc "这，就值了。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_jm_branch.rpy:1170
translate schinese ep12_msolo_label_6e1f5927:

    # mc "I would have, but there are the party preparations and all. Also, it's nice to have some peace and quiet before classes start again."
    mc "我本来是想的，但还有派对的准备呢。而且，开学前能有这么一段清净时光也挺不错的。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_jm_branch.rpy:1172
translate schinese ep12_msolo_label_b6341012:

    # my "Yeah, those are the reasons why I'm back too."
    my "嗯,那些也是我回来的原因。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_jm_branch.rpy:1174
translate schinese ep12_msolo_label_71ad9c14:

    # mc "I'm gonna let you in on something personal if you don't mind..."
    mc "我有个事儿想告诉你，如果你不介意的话……"

# episode12\branches\ep12_jm_branch.rpy:1176
translate schinese ep12_msolo_label_8e52ecb8:

    # my "I'd never mind that."
    my "我一点都不介意。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_jm_branch.rpy:1178
translate schinese ep12_msolo_label_e3dc2f23:

    # mc "I've read Mom's diary over these last few months, and I reached a point in it that...um..."
    mc "我最近几个月一直在看妈妈的日记，然后我翻到了其中一段……呃……"

# episode12\branches\ep12_jm_branch.rpy:1179
translate schinese ep12_msolo_label_8353c03f:

    # mc "It didn't shine a good light on Dad."
    mc "这事儿对爸爸的形象可不太好。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_jm_branch.rpy:1181
translate schinese ep12_msolo_label_bf0d6d4a:

    # mc "He and Mom got together while he was hired to work for her dad, and he overstepped some boundaries..."
    mc "他当时是被雇来给我爸爸打工的，结果还和我妈在房间里搞在一起，工作期间也经常越界。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_jm_branch.rpy:1182
translate schinese ep12_msolo_label_5062f3d5:

    # mc "He hooked up with Mom in her room and plenty of times during work."
    mc "他在她房间和我妈搞到了一起，工作期间也经常趁机上她。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_jm_branch.rpy:1184
translate schinese ep12_msolo_label_4c979b30:

    # mc "When my grandpa found out about it, Dad beat him."
    mc "我爷爷知道了这件事，我爸把他打了。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_jm_branch.rpy:1186
translate schinese ep12_msolo_label_2b104faa_1:

    # my "What?"
    my "什么？"

# episode12\branches\ep12_jm_branch.rpy:1188
translate schinese ep12_msolo_label_2a85946c:

    # mc "It was because he got fired for what he did to Mom. But still... It's something Dad never told me."
    mc "是因为他因为对妈妈做的事被开除了。但即便如此……爸爸从未告诉我这些。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_jm_branch.rpy:1189
translate schinese ep12_msolo_label_8a79cae2:

    # mc "I've been in fights too, and I know what it feels like... But I have never hit an adult like that."
    mc "我打过架，我知道那种感觉……但我从来没打过大人。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_jm_branch.rpy:1191
translate schinese ep12_msolo_label_940d6ff3:

    # mc "Maybe it's hypocritical of me to feel this way, but it didn't sit right with me."
    mc "也许我这样想有点虚伪，但这件事让我很不舒服。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_jm_branch.rpy:1193
translate schinese ep12_msolo_label_1c3b3f91:

    # my "Did you ask Neil about it?"
    my "你问过Neil这件事吗？"

# episode12\branches\ep12_jm_branch.rpy:1195
translate schinese ep12_msolo_label_0918c6d0:

    # mc "I did. He said he wasn't proud of what he did, and that he ended up getting sued for it, too."
    mc "我问过他了。他说他对自己所做的事并不感到骄傲，而且最后还因为这件事被起诉了。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_jm_branch.rpy:1196
translate schinese ep12_msolo_label_52b61c01:

    # mc "He also told me he gave me Mom's diary so I could see his story from her point of view."
    mc "他告诉我他还把妈妈的日记给我，好让我从她的角度看到他的故事。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_jm_branch.rpy:1197
translate schinese ep12_msolo_label_4e4da1db:

    # mc "And that he did it because he was scared to tell me the harsh reality he's protected me from..."
    mc "而且他这么做是因为他害怕告诉我那个他一直保护我免受的残酷现实..."

# episode12\branches\ep12_jm_branch.rpy:1199
translate schinese ep12_msolo_label_fe715c19:

    # mc "That made me scared to read further..."
    mc "那让我不敢继续读下去了..."

# episode12\branches\ep12_jm_branch.rpy:1200
translate schinese ep12_msolo_label_a4942f14:

    # mc "Because to me, you know... Dad is the most amazing person I know."
    mc "因为对我来说，你知道的，爸爸是我认识的最了不起的人。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_jm_branch.rpy:1201
translate schinese ep12_msolo_label_e2266cda:

    # mc "And I'd hate it if this diary told me otherwise."
    mc "而且如果这本日记告诉我不是这样，我会很讨厌的。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_jm_branch.rpy:1203
translate schinese ep12_msolo_label_d87b633b:

    # mc "Do you think I'm overreacting?"
    mc "你觉得我是不是反应太大了？"

# episode12\branches\ep12_jm_branch.rpy:1205
translate schinese ep12_msolo_label_cc30f572:

    # my "If I got it right, your dad wants to tell you things, but he doesn't feel like he can."
    my "如果我没理解错的话，你爸爸想告诉你一些事情，但他觉得自己没办法说出口。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_jm_branch.rpy:1206
translate schinese ep12_msolo_label_1872f477:

    # my "And now that you know what those things are, you're questioning if you want to hear the full story."
    my "现在你已经知道那些事是什么了，你开始怀疑自己是否还想去听完整的故事。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_jm_branch.rpy:1208
translate schinese ep12_msolo_label_69579e69:

    # mc "Yeah... My family is just Dad, you know?"
    mc "嗯... 我家就我爸，你知道的？"

# episode12\branches\ep12_jm_branch.rpy:1210
translate schinese ep12_msolo_label_910c8dd1:

    # my "You're not in touch with your grandparents at all, right?"
    my "你根本连祖父母都没联系过，对吧？"

# episode12\branches\ep12_jm_branch.rpy:1212
translate schinese ep12_msolo_label_94dacc24:

    # mc "No. I've never even met my grandpa. I don't even know what he looks like."
    mc "我没见过我爷爷，甚至不知道他长什么样子。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_jm_branch.rpy:1213
translate schinese ep12_msolo_label_bf04df80:

    # mc "And there's no one to meet on Dad's side, so... It's just us."
    mc "而且爸爸那边也没人可以见，所以……就只有我们了。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_jm_branch.rpy:1215
translate schinese ep12_msolo_label_3a4715fa:

    # my "Then I get why you feel protective of Neil. By not reading further, he'd stay the same to you."
    my "那我明白你为什么这么保护Neil了。如果他不继续读下去，他对你来说就一直是个没变的人。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_jm_branch.rpy:1217
translate schinese ep12_msolo_label_f36e5aec:

    # mc "Exactly."
    mc "正是这样。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_jm_branch.rpy:1219
translate schinese ep12_msolo_label_2db0b4d8:

    # my "But I can't help but wonder what it is he couldn't tell you."
    my "但我不禁想知道，他到底有什么是不能告诉你。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_jm_branch.rpy:1221
translate schinese ep12_msolo_label_044c0af1:

    # mc "It was about the fight and the lawsuit."
    mc "那是关于那场打架和诉讼的事。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_jm_branch.rpy:1223
translate schinese ep12_msolo_label_158e58b1:

    # my "Are you sure?"
    my "你确定吗？"

# episode12\branches\ep12_jm_branch.rpy:1225
translate schinese ep12_msolo_label_81ec15e6:

    # mc "No. But I don't want to know more..."
    mc "不过我也不想知道更多了……"

# episode12\branches\ep12_jm_branch.rpy:1227
translate schinese ep12_msolo_label_e75c34a5:

    # my "If you already made up your mind about it, go with that instinct."
    my "如果你已经下定决心了，就跟着直觉走吧。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_jm_branch.rpy:1229
translate schinese ep12_msolo_label_bc25f33c:

    # mc "But it hasn't been all bad, though... I've gotten to know Mom more. I've enjoyed that."
    mc "但也不是全都没好处……我跟妈妈更熟了，还挺享受的。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_jm_branch.rpy:1231
translate schinese ep12_msolo_label_262138b3:

    # my "It sounds to me like you need to think about this some more. And the good thing about that is that there's nothing that stops you."
    my "听起来你可能还需要再想想。而且好事就是，你随时可以停下来，不用急着做决定。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_jm_branch.rpy:1232
translate schinese ep12_msolo_label_6f0e9ce4:

    # my "If you ever want to continue reading, you can always pick up from where you left off."
    my "如果你想继续读下去，随时可以接着上次停下的地方继续。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_jm_branch.rpy:1234
translate schinese ep12_msolo_label_1275aca4:

    # my "Patrick hasn't always been the best Dad to me, but I think that our last talk about his feelings helped our relationship a lot."
    my "Patrick 不算个好爸爸，但上次我们聊到他内心感受之后，我们的关系确实好了很多。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_jm_branch.rpy:1235
translate schinese ep12_msolo_label_792aa992:

    # my "Maybe you'll be surprised how your relationship with Neil can improve further. I mean, you're not a kid anymore."
    my "也许你会惊讶，你和Neil的关系还能有进一步的改善。我说的是，你现在已经不是小孩子了。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_jm_branch.rpy:1237
translate schinese ep12_msolo_label_8999f4d6:

    # my "If he protected you from reality when you were a kid, it makes sense to me."
    my "如果他小时候保护你免受现实的伤害，我理解这种做法。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_jm_branch.rpy:1238
translate schinese ep12_msolo_label_d07db733:

    # my "And now that you're older, maybe you can return the favor by understanding why he had to do it."
    my "现在你长大了，也许可以反过来理解他当时那么做的原因。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_jm_branch.rpy:1240
translate schinese ep12_msolo_label_2b35b6fe:

    # mc "..."
    mc "..."

# episode12\branches\ep12_jm_branch.rpy:1241
translate schinese ep12_msolo_label_79bb7143:

    # mc "That makes sense. But I don't know..."
    mc "这有道理。但我不知道……"

# episode12\branches\ep12_jm_branch.rpy:1242
translate schinese ep12_msolo_label_41325b04:

    # mc "The past is the past. And he seemed relieved when I told him how much he mattered to me and that I didn't want the diary to change that."
    mc "过去的事就让它过去吧。当我告诉他我有多在乎他，以及我不想让日记改变这一点时，他看起来如释重负。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_jm_branch.rpy:1244
translate schinese ep12_msolo_label_d0ec7f56:

    # my "I'm sure you'll find a way forward. Thanks for sharing."
    my "我相信你一定能找到前进的方向。谢谢你的分享。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_jm_branch.rpy:1246
translate schinese ep12_msolo_label_32ca6295:

    # mc "How was Christmas with Patrick?"
    mc "圣诞节和Patrick过得怎么样？"

# episode12\branches\ep12_jm_branch.rpy:1248
translate schinese ep12_msolo_label_3a230624:

    # my "It went surprisingly well. We got into a discussion, but we didn't fight."
    my "进展得出乎意料地顺利。我们聊了很多，但没吵起来。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_jm_branch.rpy:1249
translate schinese ep12_msolo_label_1b749081:

    # my "Mom wasn't feeling her best, so she had to rest a lot. It left us with ample time to talk in private."
    my "我妈身体不太舒服，只好休息很多。这让我们有充足的时间私下聊天。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_jm_branch.rpy:1251
translate schinese ep12_msolo_label_4c642bfd:

    # mc "What did you guys talk about?"
    mc "你们聊了些什么？"

# episode12\branches\ep12_jm_branch.rpy:1253
translate schinese ep12_msolo_label_5d2f19ee:

    # my "Believe it or not, we talked about Josy."
    my "信不信由你，我们谈到了Josy。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_jm_branch.rpy:1254
translate schinese ep12_msolo_label_aa9cd6ee:

    # my "After he saw her at Bella's, he wanted to know why we still hung out."
    my "他在贝拉家见到她后，想知道我们为什么还会来往。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_jm_branch.rpy:1256
translate schinese ep12_msolo_label_41a1de8c:

    # my "When he first brought her up, my heart rate increased. Considering Josy was the cause of one of our bigger fights back in high school, I thought it was bound to happen again."
    my "他第一次提起她的时候，我的心跳都加快了。考虑到Josy曾经是导致我们高中时期一次大争吵的导火索，我本以为这次也逃不过。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_jm_branch.rpy:1257
translate schinese ep12_msolo_label_0080c99a:

    # my "But it didn't..."
    my "但事情并没有就此结束。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_jm_branch.rpy:1259
translate schinese ep12_msolo_label_eba64a11:

    # mc "Why was the fight about Josy back then?"
    mc "那次打架是因为Josy。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_jm_branch.rpy:1261
translate schinese ep12_msolo_label_5c38a71c:

    # my "It happened during my graduation. Josy and I were happy school had ended, and we shared some celebratory hugs and kisses when we thought no one was watching us."
    my "那是在我毕业的时候。我和Josy都挺高兴学校终于结束了，趁没人看着的时候，我们还抱了抱、亲了一下。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_jm_branch.rpy:1262
translate schinese ep12_msolo_label_451afa6e:

    # my "But Dad had been looking for me, and he found us together doing that."
    my "但爸爸一直在找我，他找到我们在一起做那事。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_jm_branch.rpy:1264
translate schinese ep12_msolo_label_cf4bff9f:

    # my "He pulled me away from her and lashed out at me. He was shocked to learn that I was into girls, and he said nasty things to me."
    my "他把我从她身边拉开，冲我发火。他震惊地发现我竟然喜欢女生，还对我骂了不少难听的话。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_jm_branch.rpy:1265
translate schinese ep12_msolo_label_04b59e21:

    # my "Later, he also forced me not to see Josy again. And yeah, you can probably guess the rest."
    my "后来他还逼我再也不见Josy。你也大概能猜到后面发生了什么。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_jm_branch.rpy:1267
translate schinese ep12_msolo_label_cd026197:

    # mc "That explains why you worried about it happening again."
    mc "这就解释了你为什么担心会再次发生。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_jm_branch.rpy:1269
translate schinese ep12_msolo_label_8b7d6ef3:

    # my "Yeah. I went into defensive mode when he brought her up. But there was no need for it."
    my "嗯，他一提到她，我就下意识地防御起来。不过其实根本没必要。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_jm_branch.rpy:1271
translate schinese ep12_msolo_label_fc645303:

    # my "..."
    my "..."

# episode12\branches\ep12_jm_branch.rpy:1273
translate schinese ep12_msolo_label_58257700:

    # my "I don't know what's happened to him. I don't think he has come around on my sexuality, but..."
    my "我不知道他怎么了。我不觉得他对我性取向有什么改变，但……"

# episode12\branches\ep12_jm_branch.rpy:1274
translate schinese ep12_msolo_label_9e532ee9:

    # my "Maybe there's something inside him that finally clicked."
    my "也许他心里有什么东西终于通了。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_jm_branch.rpy:1277
translate schinese ep12_msolo_label_78d0bb67:

    # my "Still, I didn't dare tell him that we're in a relationship."
    my "不过我也不敢告诉他我们已经在一起了。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_jm_branch.rpy:1279
translate schinese ep12_msolo_label_e406f92f:

    # my "After Dad brought Josy up... I was so close to telling him the truth about her, but I chose not to."
    my "爸爸提起Josy时，我差点把她的真相告诉他，但最后还是没有说。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_jm_branch.rpy:1280
translate schinese ep12_msolo_label_a34b368b:

    # my "I prefer Dad like he was this Christmas."
    my "我更喜欢爸爸像圣诞节那样。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_jm_branch.rpy:1281
translate schinese ep12_msolo_label_08c54655:

    # my "It reminded me of the good old days, when we grew up."
    my "这让我想起以前我们还小的时候。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_jm_branch.rpy:1284
translate schinese ep12_msolo_label_8df2a2e4:

    # mc "So, you're not going to tell him?"
    mc "所以，你打算不告诉他？"

# episode12\branches\ep12_jm_branch.rpy:1286
translate schinese ep12_msolo_label_39f3530d:

    # mc "So, you think you won't tell him?"
    mc "所以，你觉得你不会告诉他？"

# episode12\branches\ep12_jm_branch.rpy:1289
translate schinese ep12_msolo_label_41717f89:

    # my "In a perfect world, I could tell him the truth about Josy."
    my "在一个完美的世界里，我就能告诉他关于Josy的真相。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_jm_branch.rpy:1290
translate schinese ep12_msolo_label_ce2c91a5:

    # my "But the world is not perfect, and neither is anyone in it."
    my "但现实世界并不完美，而我们每个人也都不完美。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_jm_branch.rpy:1292
translate schinese ep12_msolo_label_c6da993d:

    # my "There's more to it than just telling him about her. I didn't want to ruin the nice moment we had with it."
    my "这不只是告诉他她的事情那么简单。我不想破坏我们刚才那个美好的时刻。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_jm_branch.rpy:1294
translate schinese ep12_msolo_label_8b99c9ba:

    # mc "I get it..."
    mc "我懂了..."

# episode12\branches\ep12_jm_branch.rpy:1296
translate schinese ep12_msolo_label_12274ce6:

    # mc "*{i}Groans{/i}*"
    mc "*{i}呻吟{/i}*"

# episode12\branches\ep12_jm_branch.rpy:1297
translate schinese ep12_msolo_label_2b104faa_2:

    # my "What?"
    my "什么？"

# episode12\branches\ep12_jm_branch.rpy:1299
